    :rationaleText "Control AC-2 (Account Management) contains provisions for the monitoring of accounts for unusual activity and atypical usage as part of a dynamic account management approach. By monitoring these accounts, the system may be able to detect unauthorized changes to the accounts and take the necessary steps, either automatically or by alerting personnel, to remedy and mitigate the issue." ;
